OL,3,GNEWSATwo arrested over attempted murder
OL,4,Aafter man stabbed in Newry
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo people have been arrested on
OL,7,Fsuspicion of attempted murder after a
OL,8,Fman was stabbed in Newry.
OL,10,FPolice responded to a report of an
OL,11,Fincident at a property in the Woodhill
OL,12,Farea after 06:00 BST on Sunday.
OL,14,FThe man with stab wounds was found
OL,15,Finside.
OL,17,FThe man and woman who were arrested are
OL,18,Fin their 30s and remain in police
OL,19,Fcustody. The Police Service of Northern
OL,20,FIreland has appealed to anyone with
OL,21,Finformation to come forward.
OL,23,APub: 06-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
